status GREEN -- hot roster 175 guards, 169 green, 3 red, 3 gated, 1,234s, tree_moved=no. stash_record went green under this lap's recovery. The three reds are geode_libraries (drift, regenerated and its witness re-run GREEN), shared_pen (a peer's constant-pen ceiling, not this lane's), and standing_equipment, which is the roster's self-mirror of the other two. module_room_reach, index_row_bound, reds_ledger_monotone, reds_spine_derive, unshared_citation, living_pin_near_bound each GREEN on their own run
recommend keep-going -- the census now answers whose module a room holds, and the next honest lap in this lane is the line-count instrument the row declines to build, or the arithmetic the bounds reader still wants. Worth Keaton's word on %499, now at its fourth firing in this seat: may a round open rebase onto its own uncommitted work rather than stashing it, when no peer has touched the paths?
